{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9UdXJraXNoLUxhbmd1YWdlL0RlbmdlbGVyJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Dengeler","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/pPkxrrAlzxwpKKTvDxFdDqPwGxZ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bI5x34ZGDBEd7wFTv46fGwClDnY.jpg","description":"A rigged boxing match that goes wrong connects the fates of three unaccomplished men. Ferit Kamaci is an ambitious amateur boxer who has passed the age of going pro. One night, Ferit secretly decides to get on the ring at the opening night of Rita, a nightclub in the ghettos, instead of driving his brother's taxi in that night's shift. Ilyas Kargi, a middle-aged man who is a mafia in the ghettos, owns the nightclub. He is trying to strengthen his relationship with his son through organizing an opening night match, where a discreet bet is placed. Babür Taha Öner, Ferit's cousin, bets all the money that he stole from his uncle on Ferit, trusting that he'll hit the jackpot. When Ferit knocks out his professional opponent in the ring, a series of events unfolds that lead to the death of his brother Ali.\n\nReleased 11 Oct 2024 · Turkey · Language: Turkish · 123 min\nStudio: Inter Yapım\n\nOn your server — Audio: Turkish","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Action","Crime","Drama","Others"],"imdbRating":"5.3","imdb_id":"tt34204794","moviedb_id":1243230,"tmdbId":1243230,"runtime":"123 min","cast":["Cihangir Ceyhan","Erol Babaoğlu","Tanju Bilir","Mazlum Çimen","Burak Şafak","Zamire Zeynep Özdemir","Mücahit Koçak","Canan Ürekil"],"director":["Süleyman Mert Özdemir"],"writer":["Sarp Kalfaoğlu"],"released":"2024-10-11T00:00:00.000Z","country":"Turkey","language":"Turkish","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Süleyman Mert Özdemir","character":"Director"},{"name":"Cihangir Ceyhan","character":"Ferit Kamaci","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yVC6P6VfgZ7bCEDDy7tBCHxsnO1.jpg"},{"name":"Erol Babaoğlu","character":"Ilyas Kargi","photo":"https://i